1
00:00:03,203 --> 00:00:09,563
Click Add Subject, create another content type, and add the Omnichannel Subject part the same way.

2
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:14,139
Choose Inbound, and two more settings appear.

3
00:00:14,139 --> 00:00:20,631
Interaction type is Manual, when an agent logs the call, or Automated, when an AI answers.

4
00:00:20,631 --> 00:00:22,660
Channel is Phone or SMS.

5
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:27,800
For outbound subjects these are chosen when the activities are loaded.

6
00:00:28,251 --> 00:00:34,834
The list now shows the inbound subject next to the outbound one, both marked Missing flow.

7
00:00:34,834 --> 00:00:37,371
Next, give each subject a flow.

